issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104558","id":2749101741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j2_at","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T18:48:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T18:49:39Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.5.dev 2303ce843 (Linux, GeForce RTX 4090) in Forward+ and Mobile.\n\nThis is likely a sRGB/linear color conversion issue. Both the standard uniform and per-instance uniform use `source_color` in their respective shaders though.\n\nThe issue does not occur in Compatibility:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b655b20a-13c1-4fa6-b3c4-77e0cdfbe0d1)\n\n> Hello, is this a good first issue ? I would like to start contributing to Godot.\n\nThis is likely nontrivial to fix as you'd need to figure out the exact cause of the issue. It could be in several places (the shader compiler, the renderer, the shader code).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749101741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768339123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104558#issuecomment-2768339123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104558","id":2768339123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lAYCz","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T06:44:38Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T06:44:38Z","body":"I investigated this. The cause is that the global instance uniforms buffer always use linear color:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/cc7217970d02b84122b59569cf7ed3b52cf815a6/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/material_storage.cpp#L1866\n\nI'm not sure if it can be solved in a good way.\n\n- Here is also a similar issue #70927","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768339123/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"performed_via_githu